{
  "source": "video-audit/work-opener-v16-2026-11-11/edited.wav",
  "duration": 112.8666875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.26,
      "text": "You've seen the tool, you know what the interface looks like, and you've watched it perform"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.26,
      "end": 5.78,
      "text": "a few impressive tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.54,
      "end": 7.58,
      "text": "Now it gets practical."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.14,
      "end": 9.68,
      "text": "How do you actually work with that?"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.6,
      "end": 14.06,
      "text": "There is a detail about this technology that often goes unnoticed."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.86,
      "end": 18.1,
      "text": "People tend to assume the software guarantees the outcome on its own."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.86,
      "end": 20.82,
      "text": "This graphic spells out a common reality."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.48,
      "end": 23.22,
      "text": "Same tool, different results."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.08,
      "end": 27.62,
      "text": "Two people can use the same AI system and get completely different outputs."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.22,
      "end": 29.9,
      "text": "Think of it like taking a photograph."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.78,
      "end": 32.14,
      "text": "Imagine we have two different people."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.88,
      "end": 37.3,
      "text": "Both of them are holding the exact same smartphone, and they are both trying to take a picture"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.3,
      "end": 40.12,
      "text": "of the exact same subject, let's say a sandwich."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.98,
      "end": 45.12,
      "text": "One person pulls out their phone, taps the screen without preparing a clear goal, and"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.12,
      "end": 46.1,
      "text": "quickly snaps the shot."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.56,
      "end": 50.44,
      "text": "The result is a rushed, blurry picture of lunch that you can't really use for anything."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.22,
      "end": 53.16,
      "text": "The other person takes a few extra seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.16,
      "end": 57.96,
      "text": "They check the lighting, frame the subject with intent, and steady their hands before"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.96,
      "end": 58.64,
      "text": "pressing the button."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.16,
      "end": 61.56,
      "text": "They end up with a crisp, professional-looking image."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.22,
      "end": 64.2,
      "text": "The hardware in their hands was identical."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.84,
      "end": 69.66,
      "text": "To get a crisp, highly useful response from the system, your first step is to provide"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.66,
      "end": 71.22,
      "text": "a clear, specific goal."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.06,
      "end": 77.12,
      "text": "Then, once it generates a response, you have to manually read through it, verify the facts,"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.36,
      "end": 79.6,
      "text": "and check the work before you actually apply it."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.6,
      "end": 85.46,
      "text": "Working with this software requires sandwiching its processing speed between your clear intent"
    },
    {
      "start": 85.46,
      "end": 88.24,
      "text": "at the start and your careful judgment at the end."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.9,
      "end": 91.58,
      "text": "This section will help you answer three specific questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.36,
      "end": 95.32,
      "text": "First, where could AI help the most in my work?"
    },
    {
      "start": 95.88,
      "end": 97.88,
      "text": "How do I get great answers from AI?"
    },
    {
      "start": 98.74,
      "end": 101.7,
      "text": "Finally, what can I do to make those answers even better?"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.38,
      "end": 103.88,
      "text": "Don't just use AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.74,
      "end": 105.28,
      "text": "Work with it."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.58,
      "end": 107.02,
      "text": "It doesn't replace your thinking."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.02,
      "end": 108.66,
      "text": "It multiplies it."
    }
  ],
